  exerciseNumber: 05
  exerciseName: PlayerNotMoving
  exerciseTitle: Player not moving
  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/63459441
  exerciseText: Player is not moving.
  hintText: Is the MovementSystem working? Add a log on the movement vector, does
    it behave like it should?
  solutionText: MovementSystem is using wasPressedThisFrame which is true only once
    on press instead of isPressed which is true for as long as the button is held
    down.
